In Alola, the trio once again changed to a new motto, which debuted in Loading the Dex!. The Japanese version of the Alolan motto is based on a series of , a type of Japanese proverb made up of four kanji. In English, the motto is very similar to the Unovan one. 



"*" denotes the phrase Jessie copies when they are about to announce their motto.
